   "y": 200,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 90,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "node-12",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## 反馈收敛？",
   "x": 800,
   "y": 360,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 90,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "node-13",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## 远期功能规划\n\n按 P1~P4 优先级推进",
   "x": 1180,
   "y": 40,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 90,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "node-14",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "P1 BOM 统计 + 报价清单\n用钢量 / 每瓦用钢量 / 报价表",
   "x": 1180,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 90,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "node-15",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "P2 风荷载体型系数按规范取值\nGB50009-2012 + NB/T 10115-2018",
   "x": 1180,
   "y": 340,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 90,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "node-16",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "P3 Word 计算书自动生成\npython-docx / docxtpl 模板",
   "x": 1180,
   "y": 480,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 90,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "node-17",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "P4 SAP2000 截面迭代\n.OUT 半自动 → OAPI 全自动",
